  "textHash": "2ace78d2875ed0863eca847fcedfd90eda165350e0cedb072bff7ba86ac8e5c9",
  "text": "Dodo Payments is where the money moves: refunds, credits and plan changes, run in test mode. Notary certified four Dodo behaviors before trusting them, from page limits to wallet credit units and idempotency keys. Crustdata tells the agent who each customer is, so the right policy applies. The models run through a LiteLLM gateway, with Claude as the Reflector and Adversary. And Notary is built to run on AWS: deploy scripts for a read-only hosted API on ECS, and Amazon Bedrock as a drop-in model provider, so the agents and their models can run inside a team's own AWS account.",
  "durationSec": 43.52,
